    <fileDesc>
      <titleStmt>
        <title>Diffusa est</title>
      </titleStmt>
      <pubStmt/>
      <notesStmt>
        <annot>Transcription: Corpus Monodicum (Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz / Universität Würzburg), document Pa 776-0194-2GS, https://stagedata.corpus-monodicum.de/mei/ec37732f-542f-47e2-864a-7ce8109e2706/Pa%20776-0194-2GS.xml, which transcribes the Graduale Synopticum (Universität Regensburg; database by Xaver Kainzbauer), no. 0194; © Corpus Monodicum. Pitches read an octave lower than there. The folio is the one with the complete respond and verse for the Octave of Christmas; that the Graduale Synopticum transcribes this occurrence is not verified.</annot>
      </notesStmt>
      <sourceDesc>
        <source>
